<DocsExample TExample="ButtonVariantsExample" Title="Variants" Description="Five variants express emphasis, from elevated and filled for primary actions to text for the lowest emphasis." />
<DocsExample TExample="ButtonIconsExample" Title="Leading icons" Description="A leading icon reinforces the label. Keep the label; icons alone belong on NTIconButton." />
<DocsExample TExample="ButtonSizesExample" Title="Sizes and shapes" Description="ButtonSize scales height, padding and type. Shape switches between fully round and square corners." />
<DocsExample TExample="ButtonToggleExample" Title="Toggle buttons" Description="IsToggleButton turns the button into a two-state control bound with @@bind-Selected. Text buttons cannot toggle." />
<DocsExample TExample="ButtonClickExample" Title="Handling clicks" Description="OnClickCallback runs when the button is pressed. Disabled buttons ignore input and use disabled styling." />
<DocsExample TExample="ButtonBadgeExample" Title="Badges" Description="ShowBadge adds a small dot, or a count when BadgeContent is set. BadgeAriaLabel describes it to assistive technology." />
